      "block_id": "2605.22715_p10_b11",
      "text": "AnyMo\n35.7\n29.5\n57.5\nSimulation and encoder pretraining\nw/o geometry-aware simulation\n8.4\n3.8\n16.3\nw/o masked cross-view pred. contrastive\n10.5\n4.5\n19.0\nMotion-language contrastive\nw/o label contrastive\n33.3\n27.1\n51.4\nw/o narration contrastive\n32.6\n23.8\n50.1\nw/o all contrastive\n23.5\n15.8\n40.3\nLM instruction tuning\nw/o MCQ instruction tuning\n36.0\n29.4\n54.6\n",
